# Hidden files #
################
.*
#
# Except
#
!*.env.example
!*.circleci
!*.dockeringnore
!*.hosts
!.hosts.example
!*.gitignore
!/.chglog
!/.gitallowed
!/.github
!*.gitkeep
!*.editorconfig
!*.pre-commit-config.yaml
!*.terraform.lock.hcl
apps-devstg/us-east-1/k8s-eks-demoapps/cluster/metadata.yaml
!.mcp.json
!.claude
# ...but never the runtime state a tool drops inside one. `!.claude` un-ignores
# the whole directory at any depth, so a scheduler lock carrying a PID and a
# session id became committable and rode along on an unrelated branch. Two stars
# because a pattern containing `/` is anchored to this file's directory, and
# these directories are per-layer.
**/.claude/*.lock

# SSH keys #
############
id_rsa
id_dsa

