# Project files #
####################
#
# Secret Files
#
*secrets.dec*
*secrets.dec.*
#
# Config Files
#
*common.tfvars
#
# Per-operator tfvars kept out of git (e.g. IP allowlists containing home or
# office addresses). OpenTofu still auto-loads them since they end in
# .auto.tfvars. A versioned .example sits next to each one.
# NOTE: deliberately narrower than *.auto.tfvars — plain .auto.tfvars files are
# a versioned convention in this repo (see */base-network/network.auto.tfvars).
#
*.local.auto.tfvars
#
# Scripts and Makefiles
#
/@bin/makefiles
#
# Compiled files
#
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
#
# Module directory
#
*.terraform
*terraform.jq
*plan.json
*state.json
*plan.save
#
# Terratest
#
tests/vendor/
tests/Gopkg.*

*.tgz
